Gunship development build

Enhanced framerate (CUSTOM1) is off by default and requires a 68020 or
later. On a 68000 the option is ignored and native timing is retained.
All framerate enhancements use this master option.

The experimental TIMING_RUNTIME build adds a 3 Hz world clock, responsive
player motion and renderer-only object prediction. It remains in development;
ordinary builds retain native timing.
